      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p><strong>The Hollow Barrows</strong></p><p>the Bone Choir never got the burial it was owed, and it intends to make everyone still breathing understand why that matters.</p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 0,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {}
    },
    {
      "_id": "PCZS1I6xs0dlYUta",
      "name": "Milestone 1",
      "type": "text",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>A sign of the floor's deeper story: the Bone Choir has been rebuilding an army out of everyone who's ever died on this floor - including, eventually, the party.</p><p><em>Tied to: Entrance (Room 19)</em></p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 1,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {}
    },
    {
      "_id": "kPkzWbIemLtooYUH",
      "name": "Milestone 2",
      "type": "text",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>A sign of the floor's deeper story: Something in the Crypts below is calling the recently dead home, one grave at a time.</p><p><em>Tied to: Corridor Junction (Room 17)</em></p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 2,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {}
    },
    {
      "_id": "eGotw1sQQjPKO3YG",
      "name": "Milestone 3",
      "type": "text",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>This is where the floor's story comes to a head: the Bone Choir never got the burial it was owed, and it intends to make everyone still breathing understand why that matters.</p><p><em>Tied to: Boss Arena (Room 24)</em></p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 3,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {}
    },
    {
      "_id": "QCJFXZUGfyuGvi6Z",
      "name": "Sub-story 1",
      "type": "text",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>Grave robbers hired by someone topside are already down here, and they know things about the layout the party doesn't.</p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 4,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {}
    },
    {
      "_id": "FNuo4hbmMP7jU5KI",
      "name": "Sub-story 2",
      "type": "text",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>Bones are going missing from sealed tombs, one at a time, in a pattern that spells out a name.</p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 5,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {}
    },
    {
      "_id": "Y8MkaeiLojKZh9ri",
      "name": "Sub-story 3",
      "type": "text",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>A restless spirit will not move on until an old debt, owed for generations, is finally settled.</p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 6,
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "flags": {}
    },
    {
      "_id": "ETWVOloNFTDyiWnL",
      "name": "Sub-story 4",
      "type": "text",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>A single still-living prisoner has been kept alive for decades as a witness to something the Bone Choir doesn't want forgotten - or remembered.</p>",
        "markdown": "",
        "format": 1
      },
      "sort": 7,
